WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.862
Lab 1.

2
00:00:00.862 --> 00:00:02.463
Fifteen tests pass.

3
00:00:02.463 --> 00:00:06.487
Then re-read the six waiting
findings at noon on November first.

4
00:00:06.487 --> 00:00:08.625
Three verify and would close.

5
00:00:08.625 --> 00:00:12.632
One mismatches: a terminated user
is still enabled in Entra ID,

6
00:00:12.632 --> 00:00:15.225
so it would reopen with that difference.

7
00:00:15.225 --> 00:00:19.625
One is pending: the SailPoint account
was last modified before the finding

8
00:00:19.625 --> 00:00:24.237
started waiting, so the read predates the
change and the client leaves it alone.

9
00:00:24.237 --> 00:00:28.300
And one is skipped, because its
intended state names nothing.

10
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.620
That's the case the guard exists for.
